Arara Code: generic theme-color attention hook for native view container icons.

Why a patch: WebviewView.badge (stable) and the available proposed APIs only
provide numeric badges, not the foreground of a native composite-bar icon.
The extension owns completion/unread state and supplies a theme color id through
_workbench.setViewContainerAttention(containerId, colorId | undefined). The core
only stores/renders this presentation override. No provider names or product
rules live here; selection and theme changes retain the native icon behavior.
Touches: src/vs/workbench/browser/parts/compositeBarActions.ts

